== Notes ==

* Neutral creatures are also healed.
* This spell's description lists its area of effect as "medium" when it is in fact "large". It is possible that this is a bug in the implementation; compare with ''[[mass heal]]''.
* This spell inflicts [[positive energy damage]] on undead in the affected area, unless the creature is [[PvP setting#Reactions|friendly]] to the caster.
* Due to a .2da bug, ''circle of doom'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

